# Report Generation Module

The report generation module is the core of this application, responsible for analyzing multimodal data and generating insights.

## Key Files

- [src/report_generation/main.py](mdc:src/report_generation/main.py): Orchestrates the report generation process
- [src/report_generation/crews/base_crew.py](mdc:src/report_generation/crews/base_crew.py): Base class for all crews

## Crew System

The application uses CrewAI to create specialized "crews" for different data types:

- [src/report_generation/crews/health_history_crew.py](mdc:src/report_generation/crews/health_history_crew.py): Analyzes health history visualizations
- [src/report_generation/crews/health_live_crew.py](mdc:src/report_generation/crews/health_live_crew.py): Analyzes real-time health data
- [src/report_generation/crews/youtube_history_crew.py](mdc:src/report_generation/crews/youtube_history_crew.py): Analyzes YouTube history data
- [src/report_generation/crews/youtube_live_crew.py](mdc:src/report_generation/crews/youtube_live_crew.py): Analyzes real-time YouTube data

## Tools

Each crew uses specialized tools for data processing:

- [src/report_generation/tools/file_tools.py](mdc:src/report_generation/tools/file_tools.py): File operations and image loading
- [src/report_generation/tools/vision_tools.py](mdc:src/report_generation/tools/vision_tools.py): Image analysis using vision-capable LLMs

